      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "已知下列反应在 1500 K 的平衡常数:\n(1) $\\ce{I2(g) <=> 2I(g)}$,$K_{p1} = 2.00$ bar;\n(2) $\\ce{I2(g) + H2(g) <=> 2HI(g)}$,$K_{p2}$;\n(3) $\\ce{HI(g) <=> I(g) + H(g)}$,$K_{p3} = 8.0 \\times 10^{-6}$;\n(4) $\\ce{H2(g) <=> 2H(g)}$,$K_{p4}$。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000054-02",
      "label": "6-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "计算 1500 K 体系中 $\\ce{I2(g)}$ 和 $\\ce{H2(g)}$ 未分解时的分压。$(R = 8.314\\ \\mathrm{J\\ mol^{-1}\\ K^{-1}})$"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000054-03",
      "label": "6-2",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "计算 1500 K 平衡体系中除 H(g) 之外所有物种的分压。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000054-04",
      "label": "6-3",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "计算 $K_{p2}$。"
        }
